  "id": "pokemon-battle-challenge-2009",
  "name": "Pokémon Battle Challenge 2009",
  "category": "event",
  "description": {
    "text": "Pokémon Battle Challenge (ポケモンバトルチャレンジ) toured eleven venues across Japan, from Sapporo to Fukuoka, on one weekend each between 17 October and 27 December 2009, with battles for the card game and the video games, a quiz rally and other events. Its card game event, the Knockout Battle (ノックアウトバトル), had a league for elementary school children and younger and one for junior high school students and older, each with battles for 30-card and 60-card decks of the DP series onwards, and loan decks.\n\nEveryone who took part got Hoothoot 025/L-P. Two straight wins in either the 30-card or the 60-card battles brought Noctowl 026/L-P, and two straight wins in each a gold Victory Medal showing Typhlosion, 027/L-P.",
